        _v(["namo hiraṇyabāhave hiraṇyavarṇāya |", "hiraṇyarūpāya hiraṇyapataye'mbikā pataya |", "umāpataye paśupataye^ namo_ namaḥ^"], "|| 35 ||",
           "Homage, homage to the golden-armed, the golden-coloured, the golden-formed, the lord of gold, the lord of Ambikā, the lord of Umā, the lord of beasts."),
        _v(["ṛ_tagṃ sa_tyaṃ pa^raṃ bra_hma_ pu_ruṣaṃ^ kṛṣṇa_ piṃga^ḷam |", "ū_rdhvare^taṃ vi^rūpā_kṣaṃ_ vi_śva rū^pāya_vai namo_namaḥ^"], "|| 36 ||",
           "Truth and reality, the supreme Brahman, the Puruṣa, dark and tawny, chaste, odd-eyed — homage, homage to him whose form is the universe."),
        _v(["rā_jā_dhi_rā_jāya^ prasahya sā_hine^^ |", "namo^ va_yaṃ vai^^śrava_ṇāya^ kurmahe |", "sa me_ kāmā_ nkāma_ kāmā^ya_ mahya^^m |", "kā_me_śva_ro vai^^śrava_ṇo da^dātu |", "kube_rāya^ vaiśrava_ṇāya^ mahārā_jāya_ namaḥ"], "|| 37 ||",
           "To the king of kings, who conquers by might, we pay homage, to Vaiśravaṇa. May he, the lord of desires, Vaiśravaṇa, grant me my desires, me who desire. To Kubera Vaiśravaṇa, the great king, homage."),
